## Suspension repairs and services

- Leaf spring replacements
- Shock absorber repairs and replacements
- Air suspension system diagnostics and repairs
- Bushing replacements
- Suspension alignment services
- U-bolt repairs and adjustments
- Stabilizer bar repairs

## Preventative maintenance for suspensions

Suspension inspections, bushing lubrication, shock performance checks and air
system diagnostics catch wear while it is still wear. The alternative is a
component failure that takes the tires and the alignment with it.

The suspension is also the foundation the geometry sits on: ride height and
shock condition have to be right before an alignment reading means anything.
That is why we check them first — see [the guide to maintaining heavy-duty
suspension
systems](/articles/the-ultimate-guide-to-maintaining-heavy-duty-truck-suspension-systems).

